From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:55:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] esent: embedded JET Blue engine (instances, sessions, tables,
 cursors, transactions)

esent.dll was a set of spec stubs. Implement the documented JET API over an
embedded in-process engine: instances and system parameters, sessions,
databases (create/attach/detach/open, private file format written on commit),
tables, columns (fixed/variable/tagged, multi-valued, long values, defaults,
autoincrement, NotNULL, escrow), primary/secondary/unique/descending indexes
with order-preserving keys, MakeKey/Seek/Move/index ranges/bookmarks/record
positions, PrepareUpdate/SetColumn(s)/Update/Delete, RetrieveColumn(s) and
EnumerateColumns, nested transactions with rollback, temporary tables, and the
column/index/object/table info calls (list results are temporary tables).
A and W entry points. Backup/restore/snapshot/log functions return
JET_errFeatureNotAvailable. Adds include/esent.h (from the public-domain
mingw-w64 header, with the missing grbit/prep/info-level constants added).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

