+/*
+ * Extensible Storage Engine (esent.dll)
+ *
+ * A small embedded implementation of the JET Blue database API: instances,
+ * sessions, databases, tables, columns, indexes, cursors, transactions and
+ * temporary tables.  The data model follows the documented behaviour of the
+ * API.  The database file uses a private format that this implementation
+ * reads and writes itself; files made by other engines are not readable.
